## Adding a new lo-fi component to the library

If the prototype requires a primitive that does not exist in `lofi-kit`:

1. Flag it in the plan step — do not improvise with inline styles or third-party
   components
2. Read `docs/LOFI_KIT_PATTERNS.md` → "Adding a new component" section
3. Create `lib/src/ui/ComponentName/ComponentName.tsx` + `.scss`
4. Export from `lib/src/ui/index.ts`
5. Update the component table in `docs/LOFI_KIT_PATTERNS.md` and `docs/LOFI_BLOCKS.md`
6. Run `npm run build:lofi` to verify
7. Then proceed with the prototype
